---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import throne from '../../assets/throne.jpg';
import fih from '../../assets/fih.jpg';
---

<div class="scroll-gallery">
    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> To miss someone fondly, is to admit the impact they've had on your life—and for the great, or good, that has ended. </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={fih} alt={"i am just a fih"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Money ain't real (tell em) </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={throne} alt={"throne"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Where's that diamond tester? </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={fih} alt={"i am just a fih"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Twenty-one, twenty-one, twenty-one, </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={throne} alt={"throne"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Thirty on thirty, thirty on thirty, thirty on thirty </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={fih} alt={"i am just a fih"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Hey Piccolo </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={throne} alt={"throne"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> What? </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="scroll-gallery__preview">
        <Image class="scroll-gallery__preview__image" src={fih} alt={"i am just a fih"}/>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-gallery__caption">
        <p> Did you know the IRS is significiantly underfunded to serve taxpayers and collect tax? </p>
    </div>
</div>



<style lang="scss">
    @use '../../styles/variables.scss' as *;

    .scroll-gallery {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        flex-flow: column nowrap;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;   
        color: var(--secondary-color);

        gap: 5vh;

        &__intro {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        &__caption {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            // height: 50vh;
            padding: 50vh 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: red;
            
            p { 
                font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
            }


        }
    }

</style>